<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Support | SchoolSync</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        * { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5 0%, #7C3AED 60%, #A855F7 100%); }
        .input-field {
            width: 100%; padding: 12px 16px; border: 1.5px solid #E2E8F0;
            border-radius: 10px; font-size: 14px; background: #F8FAFC;
            transition: all 0.2s; outline: none;
        }
        .input-field:focus { border-color: #4F46E5; background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79,70,229,0.1); }
        .btn-primary {
            padding: 12px 24px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5, #7C3AED);
            border: none; border-radius: 10px; color: white; font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(79,70,229,0.35); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-700">
    <header class="gradient-bg text-white py-10 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium opacity-90 hover:opacity-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to home
            </a>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-4">Support Center</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/80 text-sm">We're here to help your school get the most out of SchoolSync.</p>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 space-y-10">

        <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success && success.length) { %>
            <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 text-green-700 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
                <%= success[0] %>
            </div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error && error.length) { %>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3">
                <%= error[0] %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 p-4 shadow-sm">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question text-indigo-500 mr-2"></i>How do I reset my password?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 pl-6">Use the "Forgot Password" link on the login page. An OTP will be sent to your registered email to verify and reset your password.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 p-4 shadow-sm">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question text-indigo-500 mr-2"></i>Who do I contact for fee payment issues?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 pl-6">Fee payments are processed through Razorpay. If a payment is deducted but not reflected, contact your School Admin with the transaction reference.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 p-4 shadow-sm">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-800 text-sm mb-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-question text-indigo-500 mr-2"></i>How do I update my subscription plan?</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 pl-6">School Admins can manage subscriptions from the Subscription section of the School Admin dashboard.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Contact Support</h2>
            <form action="/support" method="POST" class="bg-white rounded-xl border border-slate-100 p-6 shadow-sm space-y-4">
                <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= typeof csrfToken !== 'undefined' ? csrfToken : '' %>">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Your Name</label>
                    <input type="text" name="name" class="input-field" placeholder="Full name" required>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" name="email" class="input-field" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1">Message</label>
                    <textarea name="message" rows="4" class="input-field" placeholder="Describe the issue you're facing..." required></textarea>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn-primary w-full md:w-auto">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane mr-2"></i> Send Message
                </button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Other Ways to Reach Us</h2>
            <ul class="text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-indigo-500 mr-2"></i>support@schoolsync.com</li>
                <li><i class="fa-solid fa-phone text-indigo-500 mr-2"></i>+91 79 1234 5678 (Mon-Sat, 9am - 6pm IST)</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="text-center text-xs text-slate-400 py-8">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SchoolSync. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
